  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *tardado*",
    "*tardar + time expression*: to take (a duration) — *Tardé dos horas en llegar* — It took me two hours to get there",
    "*tardar en + infinitive*: to take long to do something — *No tardes en llamarme* — Don't take long to call me",
    "*¡No tardes!* = Don't be long! / Hurry up!",
    "*tarde o temprano* = sooner or later (set phrase, not from this verb)",
    "Distinction: *tardar* (to take time) vs *llegar tarde* (to arrive late)"
  ],
